c4cd440a-2888-42af-8f34-c58e34a7ffe9	84	VN	VNM	VIETNAM		2021-11-15 00:00:00+00	2021-11-15 00:00:00+00			The flag of Vietnam features a large five-pointed yellow star on a red field.	https://flagcdn.com/w320/vn.png	https://flagcdn.com/vn.svg
5d2f957c-03f9-4cb5-aae1-d063648d45eb	681	WF	WLF	WALLIS AND FUTUNA		2021-11-15 00:00:00+00	2021-11-15 00:00:00+00				https://flagcdn.com/w320/wf.png	https://flagcdn.com/wf.svg
b1b6dfd1-3164-4a4a-8f55-3ce629f521be	212	EH	ESH	WESTERN SAHARA		2021-11-15 00:00:00+00	2021-11-15 00:00:00+00				https://flagcdn.com/w320/eh.png	https://flagcdn.com/eh.svg
1c28a0af-30c9-4056-a0f2-3228ac706437	967	YE	YEM	YEMEN		2021-11-15 00:00:00+00	2021-11-15 00:00:00+00			The flag of Yemen is composed of three equal horizontal bands of red, white and black.	https://flagcdn.com/w320/ye.png	https://flagcdn.com/ye.svg
b4d79a8f-68ed-46be-99df-189e69283b39	ZM	ZMB	ZAMBIA	ZAMBIA		2021-11-15 00:00:00+00	2021-11-15 00:00:00+00			The flag of Zambia has a green field, on the fly side of which is a soaring orange African fish eagle above a rectangular area divided into three equal vertical bands of red, black and orange.	https://flagcdn.com/w320/zm.png	https://flagcdn.com/zm.svg
dd99ae74-d06e-4eb0-bce2-012e35113988	263	ZW	ZWE	ZIMBABWE		2021-11-15 00:00:00+00	2021-11-15 00:00:00+00			The flag of Zimbabwe is composed of seven equal horizontal bands of green, yellow, red, black, red, yellow and green, with a white isosceles triangle superimposed on the hoist side of the field. This triangle is edged in black, spans about one-fourth the width of the field and has its base on the hoist end. A yellow Zimbabwe bird superimposed on a five-pointed red star is centered in the triangle.	https://flagcdn.com/w320/zw.png	https://flagcdn.com/zw.svg
\.
